## Acceptance
- After system-event partition, before POST: try_claim
- Claim fail → skip msg, leave in inbox (no busy-wait, no drop-without-POST)
- Success POST → release claim; failed POST → release for retry
- deliver-service Active/Primary and notifier both go through run_once (already)
- Shadow still never POSTs from service
- Hermetic or fixture tests for dual-claimer single POST
- docs/commands or design note if operator-visible